WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.002 --> 00:00:06.192
The new toolbar sits near the bottom, with large buttons and
labels you can read before you tap.

2
00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:12.580
Turn on Keep tool active, pick Rectangle, and draw two boxes
without going back to the toolbar.

3
00:00:13.082 --> 00:00:18.446
Turn it off, then pick Ellipse to add a third shape. After
that, you're back in Selection.
